    "Increase forecast lag sensitivity when sentiment history shows prolonged 0.00 values — model should not overreact to short-term noise.",
    "If true outcome consistently underperforms model in early days (e.g., 1–5 days), apply a 5–10% downward bias to subsequent forecast intervals."
